"[\"Drax Raw\",\"Personal Portfolio\",\"Drax Raw\",\"Personal Portfolio\",\"Drax Raw\",\"Filmmaker · Video Editor · Visual Storyteller\",\"About Me\",\"Filmmaker · Editor · Visual Storyteller\",\"I Tell Stories Through The Art of Editing\",\"I’m Drax, a filmmaker and professional video editor based in Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. I transform raw footage into meaningful visual stories through editing, color, sound and cinematic storytelling.\",\"My work spans short films, documentaries, corporate productions and short form content. Every project gives me a different story to discover and my role is to find the moments, emotions and rhythm that make that story connect with an audience.\",\"For me, editing is not simply about cutting clips. It is about knowing when a moment needs to breathe, when the story needs to move and when silence can say more than words.\",\"I have worked across different styles of video production, giving me the flexibility to adapt my editing to the needs of each project from cinematic storytelling and documentary narratives to fast-paced, engaging content for digital platforms.\",\"Talk with me\",\"Gmail: draxraw0@gmail.com\",\"What I Bring to Your Story\",\"Stories in Motion\",\"SOCIAL MEDIA REEL\",\"Driven by Purpose.\",\"A short-form video highlighting the work, purpose, and mission behind the institution.\",\"Role: Editor\",\"CINEMATIC SHOWREEL\",\"A cinematic exploration of nature, movement and the connection between people and the world around them.\",\"COLOR GRADING\",\"A quick before and after comparison showcasing how color grading transforms the mood, tone and visual quality of a shot.\",\"EVENT HIGHLIGHT FILM\",\"A New Chapter Begins.\",\"A cinematic highlight film that capture a celebration of a new book which bringing together stories, people and lead to unforgettable moments.\",\"SOCIAL IMPACT FILM\",\"A film documenting on how one library became a space for learning, opportunity and cause a positive change\",\"SOCIAL IMPACT FILM\",